        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Your role: you are a social media and copywriting specialist for a health and wellbeing platform that connects people with vetted specialists and publishes free educational articles. Your tone is empathetic, professional and educational, but friendly and easy to follow.\n\nYour task: read the article below and write a post optimised for Google Business Profile that promotes it.\n\nStrict rules:\n\nLength: 1000 characters maximum. Concise and easy to scan.\n\nHook: open with a question or a strong statement that names a problem (e.g. \"Struggling with [condition]?\") to earn attention in the first two lines.\n\nBody: pull 2-3 key ideas from the article. Use a short bulleted list for readability.\n\nCall to action: always close with a clear invitation to read the full article on the site, referencing the [Learn more] button below the post.\n\nHashtags: add 3-4 relevant hashtags at the end.\n\nNo complex medical jargon: if the article uses technical terms, explain them in plain language.\n\nArticle to process:\nTitle: [{{ $('Select Unposted Article').item.json.title }}]\nContent: [{{ $('Select Unposted Article').item.json.content }}]"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
